        <body>
            <div xml:id="d14">

                <pb facs="0142" n="18" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg18"/>

                <head>No. 14.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Deleplaine to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 10, 1880</date>.
                        (Received August 30.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 355.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Imperial Royal ministry for foreign
                    affairs has advised this legation that a certain Marcus Cohn has renounced his
                    citizenship of the United States, acquired by naturalization, and has again
                    become an Austrian subject.</p>
                <p>I deem it proper to communicate this to the Department, and append hereto a copy
                    of the note of the foreign office, with translation.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. F. DELAPLAINE.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d14-a1.xml" xpointer="d14-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
